WEBVTT

01:24.920 --> 01:27.360
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:34.160 --> 01:35.680
So much money!

01:36.200 --> 01:37.280
Don't speak.

01:38.000 --> 01:38.920
However,

01:39.000 --> 01:42.280
this Sea God Festival's treasure pool
is filled with hidden swords.

01:42.360 --> 01:44.560
Danger lurks everywhere.

01:44.640 --> 01:46.960
It's a matter of life and death.

01:47.040 --> 01:48.600
Anyone volunteering to go first?

01:51.440 --> 01:53.320
Anyone willing to step up?

01:54.800 --> 01:57.800
If no one goes forward,
then we'll draw lots.

02:00.320 --> 02:03.520
Whoever draws the red lot
will be the one to go.

02:03.600 --> 02:04.440
Who will draw first?

02:14.600 --> 02:15.800
Assistant Pang,

02:15.880 --> 02:18.040
I heard Duanwu used to dive for pearls.

02:18.640 --> 02:20.240
She must be a good swimmer.

02:20.320 --> 02:21.640
Why don't we let her go first?

02:21.720 --> 02:23.360
Good swimmer?

02:24.440 --> 02:26.680
Duanwu, why don't you draw first?

02:30.640 --> 02:31.480
Please.

02:36.280 --> 02:37.480
Sister…

02:49.080 --> 02:49.920
Congratulations!

02:50.000 --> 02:53.040
Reporting to Master.
Duanwu drew the red lot.

03:00.400 --> 03:01.920
Why are they all red lots?

03:02.000 --> 03:03.600
You're trying to set us up, aren't you?

03:03.680 --> 03:05.520
-You're tricking us, deceiving my sister!
-This…

03:05.600 --> 03:07.000
I really didn't know!

03:07.080 --> 03:08.440
I had no idea!

03:08.520 --> 03:10.000
Mr. Cao.

03:10.080 --> 03:11.240
Leave!

03:12.160 --> 03:13.120
Yes.

03:17.720 --> 03:19.880
It doesn't count. We'll draw again.

03:21.160 --> 03:22.000
Master.

03:23.440 --> 03:24.680
I'll go.

03:27.560 --> 03:28.680
You?

03:28.760 --> 03:30.600
Today, we have to send someone.

03:31.760 --> 03:33.960
I'm a good swimmer. I'll go.

03:34.040 --> 03:37.280
Fine. My trading convoy
always rewards courage and loyalty.

03:37.920 --> 03:40.520
Since you volunteered,
your bravery is admirable.

03:41.240 --> 03:42.720
If you win the competition,

03:44.600 --> 03:46.200
I'll give you an extra million.

03:47.120 --> 03:48.800
If I win the Treasure Hunt,

03:50.480 --> 03:52.160
could you officially allow me
to join Yan's Trading Convoy?

03:57.320 --> 03:58.240
Deal.

03:59.480 --> 04:01.080
If you win the Treasure Hunt,

04:02.160 --> 04:03.320
I'll let you join the convoy.

04:05.800 --> 04:06.680
Thank you, Master.

04:15.320 --> 04:16.399
Master, any instructions?

04:20.279 --> 04:23.120
During tomorrow's competition, wear this.

04:33.120 --> 04:34.000
What's special about it?

04:35.600 --> 04:36.920
It'll keep you from dying in the water.

04:39.720 --> 04:41.040
My life or death…

04:42.560 --> 04:44.040
-does it matter?
-It doesn't.

04:45.200 --> 04:47.200
But you must succeed in the hunt.

04:47.280 --> 04:48.280
Understood.

04:50.320 --> 04:51.560
But don't worry, Master.

04:52.600 --> 04:54.000
I've done this since I was young.

04:55.440 --> 04:56.720
Tomorrow's situation
will be unusually dangerous.

04:56.800 --> 04:58.120
Can I raise the price further?

04:58.720 --> 04:59.640
No.

05:04.040 --> 05:05.720
I know my life is worthless,

05:06.720 --> 05:08.320
but your jewels are valuable.

05:09.320 --> 05:12.440
-Don't I deserve a better price?
-They are, but you have no choice.

05:13.440 --> 05:15.480
In truth, if you gave up
on the blood-stained pearl now,

05:15.560 --> 05:17.400
you could walk away

05:17.480 --> 05:18.480
and wouldn't need to wade into this mess.

05:21.200 --> 05:22.920
If I don't get the pearl back,

05:26.240 --> 05:27.680
I won't find my father.

05:36.200 --> 05:37.520
Enough. Go now.

05:43.280 --> 05:44.200
Thank you, Master.

05:51.120 --> 05:52.200
Great!

05:52.280 --> 05:55.320
Awesome!

06:07.600 --> 06:09.080
Very well!

06:10.840 --> 06:13.440
Excellent!

06:24.560 --> 06:25.680
Good!

06:26.480 --> 06:29.000
Wonderful!

06:31.440 --> 06:32.960
CALM SEAS FOR SAFE TRAVELS
FORTUNE AND PROSPERITY GATHER

06:33.040 --> 06:34.520
Amazing!

06:37.640 --> 06:41.160
We're honoring the Sea Goddess
at this Temple of the South Sea God,

06:41.920 --> 06:45.240
praying for calm seas, abundant catches,

06:45.320 --> 06:47.480
and safe travels for traders.

06:47.560 --> 06:49.520
Today, we encircle the sea into a pool

06:49.600 --> 06:51.520
for the Treasure Hunt.

06:51.600 --> 06:55.400
We invite all good-hearted souls
to show benevolence

06:55.480 --> 06:57.000
for peace and prosperity.

06:59.000 --> 07:00.400
For this Sea God Festival,

07:00.480 --> 07:03.960
we have chosen the emerald
presented by Yan's Trading Convoy

07:04.680 --> 07:08.280
as the prize for the Treasure Hunt.

07:08.960 --> 07:10.440
Let the servants enter.

07:10.520 --> 07:12.960
Participants in this Treasure Hunt

07:13.040 --> 07:15.560
include Yan's Trading Convoy
from the West,

07:15.640 --> 07:17.200
the Cui family from Yangzhou,

07:17.280 --> 07:20.880
Bohai Lake Merchants,
and the Mingzhou Merchant Group.

07:34.640 --> 07:37.240
The Sea God Festival's Treasure Hunt

07:37.320 --> 07:39.680
begins now!

07:39.760 --> 07:41.600
Great!

07:59.520 --> 08:01.880
Once they enter the water,
their lives are at stake.

08:02.520 --> 08:04.680
With them involved,
it was never going to be simple.

08:05.280 --> 08:06.840
Ready!

08:21.800 --> 08:22.680
Hold on!

08:23.880 --> 08:26.760
The Sea Festival is a local tradition,

08:27.480 --> 08:29.080
passed down for over a century.

08:29.160 --> 08:32.520
Its purpose is to bring blessings

08:32.600 --> 08:33.640
and a bountiful harvest to all.

08:33.720 --> 08:38.720
Such brutality now
goes against its original intent.

08:38.799 --> 08:41.039
As the Special Envoy of Treasures,

08:41.120 --> 08:43.919
I absolutely forbid such cruelty

08:44.000 --> 08:46.360
within my jurisdiction.

08:46.880 --> 08:48.480
Therefore, I propose

08:48.560 --> 08:52.520
we move this contest to the shore.

08:52.600 --> 08:55.440
Let each team compete
and just determine the winner.

08:55.520 --> 08:58.320
In plain view of all,
with justice and transparency.

08:58.400 --> 09:00.560
One stick of incense for time.

09:00.640 --> 09:03.720
Whoever snatches the treasure wins!

09:14.840 --> 09:16.120
Light the incense!

09:20.280 --> 09:22.480
Time starts now!

09:33.360 --> 09:34.480
Stop her!

10:19.680 --> 10:21.800
Yan Zijing, what are you aiming for?

10:21.880 --> 10:22.880
Victory.

10:22.960 --> 10:24.120
But Duanwu is innocent!

10:24.760 --> 10:25.920
No one is innocent.

10:26.000 --> 10:27.120
Mr. Zhang, you have a heart to save others

10:27.200 --> 10:28.360
but lacks the power to do so.

10:29.240 --> 10:31.600
It's because you've never known
the suffering of this world.

10:32.200 --> 10:34.320
This world suffers
because of people like you.

10:34.400 --> 10:35.240
That's why there's hardship.

10:36.840 --> 10:38.320
I said no one is innocent.

10:48.840 --> 10:50.160
Don't worry. She won't die.

10:54.320 --> 10:57.240
My junior brother
seems to care quite a bit

10:57.320 --> 10:59.160
for that pearl diver.

10:59.240 --> 11:01.080
For that pearl diver,

11:01.160 --> 11:04.120
he spent a fortune at the pearl auction
to cheer her on.

11:04.720 --> 11:07.160
Then he even revealed his identity
with the gold willow leaf.

11:07.240 --> 11:09.040
He's young yet

11:09.760 --> 11:11.320
and needs more tempering.

11:11.400 --> 11:13.360
He has some attachments.

11:14.480 --> 11:15.680
That's easier to manage.

13:06.280 --> 13:07.320
Duanwu!

13:07.400 --> 13:08.960
Duanwu!

13:10.680 --> 13:12.000
I'll take her away.

13:47.080 --> 13:48.360
The servants are after the treasure,

13:49.000 --> 13:50.400
and, Master Yan,
you intervened personally.

13:50.480 --> 13:51.320
What's your purpose?

13:54.520 --> 13:57.080
This is what you meant
by "just determine the winner"?

13:57.160 --> 13:58.640
I thought this Treasure Hunt

13:58.720 --> 14:01.640
was supposed to be a sincere ritual
for the well-being of the people.

14:01.720 --> 14:04.680
Otherwise, I would never
have offered my priceless emerald.

14:06.400 --> 14:08.000
But I didn't expect

14:08.080 --> 14:11.200
that the Sea Festival rules
could change at will

14:11.280 --> 14:13.720
or that some people would use
such low tactics

14:14.640 --> 14:17.120
to turn a holy ritual
into a violent struggle.

14:17.200 --> 14:20.560
The Sea God Festival's Treasure Hunt
has long been a tradition.

14:21.120 --> 14:23.800
Whether it's held in the sea or onshore

14:23.880 --> 14:25.880
is merely a matter of form.

14:25.960 --> 14:27.600
When Special Envoy Xu announced
the rules earlier,

14:27.680 --> 14:29.080
I didn't hear you object.

14:29.160 --> 14:32.480
Now that you've lost, you argue.

14:32.560 --> 14:33.920
My servant

14:34.000 --> 14:37.440
claimed the treasure
just as the incense burned out.

14:38.200 --> 14:40.680
The Cui family is victorious.

14:40.760 --> 14:44.360
Yan's Trading Convoy operates worldwide
on a foundation of honesty.

14:44.440 --> 14:46.160
Reputation is what we value.

14:48.160 --> 14:49.320
Today, I lost.

14:50.400 --> 14:51.240
I accept that.

14:51.320 --> 14:54.880
Master Yan, don't forget
the promise we made.

14:55.440 --> 14:58.040
Now that I've won this Treasure Hunt,

14:58.120 --> 15:00.280
you must give up

15:02.560 --> 15:04.360
the pearl procurement rights in Lingnan.

15:04.440 --> 15:07.000
You're a man of your word.

15:07.080 --> 15:10.040
You won't go back on it, will you?

15:14.240 --> 15:15.080
Naturally, I won't.

15:26.840 --> 15:29.560
Everyone, today, the Cui family has won.

15:29.640 --> 15:31.680
We will prepare the ritual offerings

15:31.760 --> 15:33.640
to honor the Temple of the South Sea God,

15:33.720 --> 15:35.480
praying for favorable winds and rain

15:35.560 --> 15:37.360
and safe journeys for all traders.

15:38.160 --> 15:40.280
This is all I can do.

15:40.360 --> 15:43.360
What comes next is up to you.

15:45.920 --> 15:47.720
We'll need more help from you.

15:48.720 --> 15:51.320
Yan Zijing is just a merchant,
hardly a real threat.

15:52.240 --> 15:54.920
I've taken care of your biggest worry.

15:55.840 --> 15:56.680
And you?

16:00.240 --> 16:01.600
Rest assured, Special Envoy Xu.

16:01.680 --> 16:03.680
Zhang Jinran is here without protection.

16:03.760 --> 16:05.640
He likely won't leave Guangzhou
in one piece.

16:05.720 --> 16:07.800
Whether he can leave Guangzhou or not
is not my concern.

16:08.600 --> 16:10.600
Prince Tan's birthday banquet
is approaching,

16:10.680 --> 16:12.640
and regarding the Pearl Lotus Terrace…

16:13.560 --> 16:14.720
Do I need to remind you?

16:17.960 --> 16:18.880
Understood.

16:27.880 --> 16:28.880
Let's go.

16:35.320 --> 16:38.640
HEFU HALL

16:51.320 --> 16:52.480
You're awake, Duanwu.

16:55.160 --> 16:56.880
Feeling any better? Here,

16:57.760 --> 16:58.840
take this medicine first.

17:08.839 --> 17:09.839
Thank you, Mr. Zhang.

17:11.880 --> 17:12.720
Feeling better?

17:24.079 --> 17:25.960
Mr. Zhang, where is this place?

17:27.319 --> 17:29.080
This is the medical hall.

17:29.160 --> 17:30.720
The doctor just said

17:30.800 --> 17:32.320
you had some old injuries from before,

17:32.400 --> 17:34.240
and the Treasure Hunt added
a few new ones.

17:35.360 --> 17:38.320
Fortunately,
you were wearing this soft armor,

17:38.400 --> 17:39.440
which saved your life.

17:40.040 --> 17:42.040
You must rest well from now on

17:42.640 --> 17:43.880
or these injuries could become chronic.

17:48.960 --> 17:50.160
Duanwu,

17:51.200 --> 17:52.080
a female doctor treated you.

17:54.480 --> 17:55.400
Thank you, Mr. Zhang.

17:59.480 --> 18:01.840
Duanwu, I won't ask

18:01.920 --> 18:03.880
why you helped Yan Zijing
with the Treasure Hunt.

18:06.040 --> 18:08.360
I only know
you can't treat yourself like this,

18:08.440 --> 18:09.320
risking your life recklessly.

18:09.400 --> 18:10.800
At this point,

18:11.640 --> 18:13.680
I can't give up any opportunity.

18:15.120 --> 18:17.400
I chose to join the Treasure Hunt.

18:17.480 --> 18:18.920
But what kind of opportunity is this?

18:23.880 --> 18:26.160
What opportunity
is worth risking your life?

18:27.200 --> 18:29.400
What's the difference between this
and diving for pearls?

18:30.440 --> 18:32.880
Staying close to Yan Zijing
isn't the only future for you.

18:33.480 --> 18:35.200
How can you get blood from a stone?

18:38.280 --> 18:40.080
I'll tell you the truth.

18:40.160 --> 18:42.280
Yan Zijing sent you to the Treasure Hunt

18:43.080 --> 18:45.000
merely to settle a bet with Cui Shijiu.

18:45.080 --> 18:47.800
All he wants is to control all the pearls
in Guangzhou.

18:48.400 --> 18:49.800
But he lost this time.

19:12.160 --> 19:13.200
Come with me to Chang'an.

19:15.520 --> 19:18.920
The Directorate of Construction there
has the finest skills of the Tang.

19:20.240 --> 19:21.720
Here's my letter
of recommendation for you.

19:22.320 --> 19:23.400
There,

19:24.520 --> 19:26.680
you could learn a craft
to support yourself.

19:46.720 --> 19:48.920
If I go with you to Chang'an,

19:49.000 --> 19:52.840
wouldn't that mean
I'd be even further from my freedom?

19:57.680 --> 19:58.880
Mr. Zhang,

19:58.960 --> 20:00.840
I lost the Treasure Hunt.

20:02.800 --> 20:05.040
But I've already brought my partner
into the Mirage.

20:06.240 --> 20:07.720
There's no way I can simply leave.

20:11.480 --> 20:14.280
You have been so kind to me.

20:16.160 --> 20:17.880
So kind

20:18.600 --> 20:19.800
that I dare not accept it.

20:21.680 --> 20:24.360
But one day, if I'm able

20:24.440 --> 20:26.640
and find a way to repay your kindness,

20:28.120 --> 20:29.360
I'll surely return the favor.

20:35.160 --> 20:36.160
Alright.

20:39.680 --> 20:40.840
Then I'll wait.

20:42.040 --> 20:44.800
But for now,
you should accept this kindness

20:45.560 --> 20:46.640
as a way

20:48.360 --> 20:49.680
to leave yourself an escape.

20:59.240 --> 21:00.560
I'll wait outside for you.

21:01.880 --> 21:03.240
I'll take you back later.

21:43.680 --> 21:45.000
ANCESTRAL TABLET OF THE YAN FAMILY

21:45.080 --> 21:46.200
LATE FATHER'S MEMORIAL TABLET

21:46.280 --> 21:47.320
LATE MOTHER'S MEMORIAL TABLET

22:01.680 --> 22:04.080
Pull the strings downward.
Watch your hand's movement.

22:04.160 --> 22:05.760
Enough. Take a break.

22:05.840 --> 22:06.880
Once we successfully

22:06.960 --> 22:10.320
deliver the Apsaras statue tribute
for the State of Yan,

22:10.400 --> 22:11.760
not just Yangzhou's jewelry guild

22:11.840 --> 22:13.400
but the entire jewelry industry

22:13.480 --> 22:16.720
will look to the Yan family.

22:23.840 --> 22:24.800
Kill them all!

22:24.880 --> 22:26.440
-Protect the statue!
-Yes, sir!

22:48.080 --> 22:49.120
Leave no one alive. Kill them!

23:03.600 --> 23:05.240
-Go!
-Alright!

23:07.120 --> 23:08.720
Quick, go! Move!

23:14.280 --> 23:15.120
Take Zijing and go first!

23:15.200 --> 23:17.000
-Let's leave together!
-No, go now!

23:17.080 --> 23:18.000
You go first!

23:18.080 --> 23:19.640
-Dad!
-Hurry! Go!

23:19.720 --> 23:20.760
Dad!

23:22.440 --> 23:23.640
Dad!

23:23.720 --> 23:25.160
Go!

23:25.240 --> 23:26.200
Come back!

23:44.240 --> 23:45.680
Dad!

23:47.400 --> 23:49.560
Dad!

23:55.840 --> 24:00.120
Dad!

24:04.880 --> 24:07.360
Dad!

24:12.040 --> 24:13.840
Dad!

24:48.720 --> 24:51.280
Are some things too hard to forget?

24:52.000 --> 24:54.000
Why force yourself to remember?

24:58.600 --> 24:59.880
If I forget even this,

25:01.760 --> 25:03.360
then what's the point of living?

25:04.800 --> 25:07.480
Your mother barely escaped with you,

25:08.040 --> 25:09.600
only to be intercepted by Cui Ding.

25:09.680 --> 25:11.280
But their deaths

25:12.440 --> 25:14.040
were meant to give you a chance
to live well.

25:15.760 --> 25:17.240
Only when I've avenged them

25:19.760 --> 25:21.640
can I truly live in peace.

25:25.680 --> 25:26.680
Here.

25:34.000 --> 25:35.840
Treasure Hunt is naturally dangerous.

25:35.920 --> 25:38.800
Putting all your trust in one young girl,

25:40.160 --> 25:42.160
-you should've anticipated the risk.
-Are you saying

25:43.680 --> 25:45.320
I've staked everything this time?

25:45.400 --> 25:48.320
You always keep a backup plan.

25:48.400 --> 25:49.800
But what if I told you

25:50.400 --> 25:51.880
that this time, I really have no fallback,

25:53.160 --> 25:54.560
that I truly staked it all?

25:54.640 --> 25:58.080
Master, Mr. Zhang escorted Duanwu
back to the ship.

26:04.560 --> 26:06.760
Mr. Zhang, thank you for today.

26:06.840 --> 26:07.880
I'll head back now.

26:07.960 --> 26:09.880
You're unwell. Let me escort you up.

26:10.720 --> 26:12.000
No need. I can manage.

26:12.080 --> 26:13.680
It's fine. Let's go.

26:23.240 --> 26:24.120
Oh, Mr. Zhang's here.

26:24.200 --> 26:25.960
You're truly considerate, huh?

26:26.040 --> 26:27.760
Escorting my servant girl to the doctor

26:27.840 --> 26:29.040
and even bringing her back.

26:30.160 --> 26:32.600
I'm humbled by your courtesy.

26:43.200 --> 26:44.960
Is this what you call

26:46.760 --> 26:47.600
"humbled"?

26:49.120 --> 26:51.840
I only just recognized you.

26:52.440 --> 26:54.360
Besides, boarding the ship
at this late hour,

26:54.440 --> 26:55.560
who knows if it's friend or foe?

26:56.160 --> 26:59.320
What if it were someone
coming aboard to steal?

27:05.280 --> 27:06.480
Duanwu.

27:11.760 --> 27:14.320
Mr. Zhang, my apologies.

27:15.200 --> 27:16.880
I'll take my leave now.
Thank you for today.

27:21.760 --> 27:24.200
This is a peace token
granted by His Majesty.

27:24.280 --> 27:25.520
Wear it day and night.

27:25.600 --> 27:27.680
-It will ensure your safety.
-I don't need it.

27:27.760 --> 27:29.880
-Wear it.
-Mr. Zhang, I truly cannot accept it.

27:29.960 --> 27:30.880
-Take it.
-I really shouldn't.

27:30.960 --> 27:31.920
Duanwu!

27:36.320 --> 27:38.640
Don't worry, Mr. Zhang. I'll be fine.

27:47.760 --> 27:50.160
Three, two,

27:51.440 --> 27:52.360
one.

27:52.440 --> 27:53.280
Master.

27:57.400 --> 27:58.240
What?

27:58.880 --> 27:59.840
Are you scared?

28:01.160 --> 28:02.720
Mr. Zhang only brought me back
out of kindness.

28:03.400 --> 28:05.120
Have you forgotten your days
at the pearl farm?

28:05.200 --> 28:07.040
There aren't that many
kind-hearted people in this world.

28:07.920 --> 28:09.080
Mr. Zhang is a good man.

28:09.160 --> 28:10.840
So, I'm the bad one?

28:12.280 --> 28:14.480
Do you know what punishment awaits you

28:14.560 --> 28:16.240
for losing the Treasure Hunt?

28:18.160 --> 28:20.040
I believe if you're willing,

28:20.120 --> 28:21.880
Mr. Zhang will take you away.

28:27.840 --> 28:29.080
I won't go with him.

28:31.800 --> 28:32.760
All for the blood-stained pearl?

28:33.720 --> 28:35.080
The ransom is only three million.

28:35.880 --> 28:37.960
Mr. Zhang could cover that
with just a gold willow leaf.

28:38.040 --> 28:39.760
I can get the pearl back myself,

28:41.720 --> 28:42.680
without anyone's help.

28:43.760 --> 28:44.960
Then I'll punish you. Will you accept it?

28:46.400 --> 28:47.280
I'll accept it.

28:49.240 --> 28:50.320
Come in.

28:54.360 --> 28:56.560
Mr. Zhang asked me to treat you kindly,

28:56.640 --> 28:57.800
and I'll give him that respect.

28:57.880 --> 28:59.360
So, I'm giving you two choices.

28:59.440 --> 29:00.840
The first,

29:00.920 --> 29:02.480
from now on,

29:02.560 --> 29:05.440
you'll have nothing to do
with trading convoy business.

29:05.520 --> 29:07.680
You'll come to the upper deck
to serve as my attendant,

29:07.760 --> 29:09.160
serving only me alone.

29:09.840 --> 29:12.760
Naturally, forget
about ever getting the pearl back.

29:16.800 --> 29:17.720
Fine.

29:19.320 --> 29:21.920
-I'll take the second.
-You'll be lashed 20 times

29:23.040 --> 29:25.360
and sent back to the lower deck.

29:25.440 --> 29:28.080
If you want to rise in the convoy,
you'll have to climb step by step.

29:32.080 --> 29:33.080
I accept the punishment.

29:34.840 --> 29:35.680
Kang Ju,

29:36.760 --> 29:38.200
-do it.
-Master,

29:38.280 --> 29:39.640
the punishment is decided.

29:39.720 --> 29:43.160
Then, what will you reward me with?

29:43.240 --> 29:44.520
Why would I reward you?

29:45.760 --> 29:47.120
I accept that I lost the Treasure Hunt,

29:47.200 --> 29:49.440
but through my desperate effort,

29:49.520 --> 29:51.640
I earned fame for Yan's Trading Convoy.

29:52.520 --> 29:53.440
Don't I deserve a reward?

29:54.120 --> 29:55.200
This time, Western colored jewels

29:55.280 --> 29:57.320
have made a grand impression
before all Guangzhou merchants.

29:57.400 --> 29:59.000
This jewelry market

29:59.520 --> 30:00.880
should bring in a good profit.

30:01.560 --> 30:02.520
How do you know that?

30:02.600 --> 30:04.280
When I boarded just now,
I saw with my own eyes

30:04.360 --> 30:06.600
that the servants were moving goods
in and out of the ship.

30:06.680 --> 30:09.200
That's when I realized,
congratulations, Master,

30:09.840 --> 30:12.520
the stock has been cleared out,
and new goods have arrived.

30:13.960 --> 30:15.320
You think you're so clever, huh?

30:17.000 --> 30:19.320
I had already signed a contract
with Guangzhou's guild lead.

30:19.400 --> 30:21.920
This campaign was merely
to speed up the sales process.

30:22.000 --> 30:23.480
But don't forget.

30:23.560 --> 30:25.240
You cost me

30:25.320 --> 30:28.520
the right to purchase all the pearls
in Guangzhou.

30:31.840 --> 30:33.400
Yan's Trading Convoy can't buy pearls,

30:34.560 --> 30:35.800
but what about other merchants?

30:37.440 --> 30:40.000
Previously, we sold coral pearls
to Zhuobao House.

30:40.920 --> 30:42.040
Could we

30:42.120 --> 30:44.720
have Zhuobao House procure pearls
on our behalf?

30:44.800 --> 30:47.760
With so many businesses in Guangzhou,
why Zhuobao House?

30:47.840 --> 30:49.920
Zhuobao House
is Guangzhou's largest jewelry house.

30:50.000 --> 30:51.800
And I heard

30:51.880 --> 30:54.440
Feng's Jewelry and the Guangzhou Guild

30:54.520 --> 30:55.880
have some subtle ties.

30:56.560 --> 30:59.320
Feng's Jewelry never works
with local merchants.

30:59.400 --> 31:00.560
They have their own system.

31:00.640 --> 31:03.680
But with a century-old reputation,
no one dares to interfere.

31:03.760 --> 31:05.440
You had long been planning this move,

31:05.520 --> 31:07.240
intending to sell coral pearls
to Zhuobao House

31:07.320 --> 31:09.400
and establishing ties with them.

31:09.480 --> 31:12.600
It's just that Mr. Cao failed
to handle it.

31:12.680 --> 31:16.160
By accident, I made it. Isn't that right?

31:21.200 --> 31:24.440
So, what makes you think
Zhuobao House will definitely help us?

31:24.520 --> 31:26.720
I know Lady Wu of Zhuobao House.

31:27.760 --> 31:28.600
I can ask her.

31:28.680 --> 31:31.160
All your dealings with her
are just minor trades.

31:32.120 --> 31:32.960
Will she help you?

31:33.040 --> 31:35.040
Through the coral pearl collaboration,

31:35.120 --> 31:36.360
she considers me a friend.

31:36.440 --> 31:37.960
I trust she'll help me.

31:38.040 --> 31:39.800
Even blood relatives keep clear accounts.

31:39.880 --> 31:41.120
Haven't you been tricked enough?

31:44.640 --> 31:45.960
Lady Wu isn't like that.

31:47.400 --> 31:49.600
I want all the pearls in Guangzhou.

31:49.680 --> 31:50.720
Understood.

31:51.840 --> 31:52.840
Not a single one will be missing.

31:56.360 --> 31:58.720
But I'll need an advance from you, Master.

31:58.800 --> 32:00.960
Once Zhuobao House places a deposit,

32:01.040 --> 32:02.720
we'll monopolize all the pearls
in Guangzhou.

32:02.800 --> 32:05.080
When Cui Shijiu scrambles
to gather tribute pearls,

32:05.160 --> 32:07.600
she'll have to buy from you at any cost.

32:09.520 --> 32:10.920
I won't sell her a single one.

32:18.720 --> 32:19.760
So…

32:20.920 --> 32:24.280
about the cooperation with Zhuobao House,

32:24.360 --> 32:25.800
is it feasible?

32:25.880 --> 32:26.720
It's feasible.

32:29.160 --> 32:32.000
-Could I have a clear title?
-Sure.

32:32.080 --> 32:34.360
-I'll bring Shrimp along with me.
-Approved.

32:36.640 --> 32:37.480
Then, the deposit…

32:38.640 --> 32:40.240
Go ask Accountant Wei for it.

32:40.320 --> 32:42.200
I should ask Accountant Wei?

32:42.280 --> 32:43.280
How would she ever give it to me?

32:43.360 --> 32:45.920
Then use your head.

32:50.080 --> 32:51.040
Anything else?

33:02.280 --> 33:03.160
Master,

33:04.920 --> 33:06.640
about those 20 lashes…

33:07.800 --> 33:09.920
can they be postponed?

33:10.000 --> 33:10.960
They can.

33:12.800 --> 33:14.280
But if you don't accomplish this task,

33:16.880 --> 33:17.720
you'll receive double punishment.

33:20.800 --> 33:21.920
Off you go.

33:38.080 --> 33:40.640
Having Zhuobao House
procure pearls for you

33:41.880 --> 33:43.520
is your backup plan?

33:45.840 --> 33:46.680
Take a guess.

33:48.320 --> 33:49.400
I won't guess.

33:50.000 --> 33:52.040
Whether I'm right or wrong,
it won't end well.

33:57.280 --> 33:58.720
This Duanwu…

34:00.360 --> 34:02.080
is becoming more and more like you.

34:20.600 --> 34:23.120
Sister, you're finally back!

34:24.159 --> 34:25.760
You worried us to death!

34:25.840 --> 34:28.199
I'm fine. Why aren't you asleep yet?

34:30.639 --> 34:32.600
Sister, are you really okay?

34:33.840 --> 34:34.920
Let me see.

34:41.000 --> 34:41.880
I'm truly fine.

34:41.960 --> 34:45.159
You saw through their schemes.
Why did you still agree?

34:49.840 --> 34:51.719
If today, we escaped

34:53.760 --> 34:54.960
the Treasure Hunt,

34:55.600 --> 34:56.520
what about next time?

34:58.080 --> 34:59.760
As long as we're on this ship,

35:01.440 --> 35:04.080
they'll keep coming.

35:05.880 --> 35:10.800
So, the only way is to make Master
recognize us as part of the convoy.

35:10.880 --> 35:11.880
This way,

35:12.480 --> 35:14.640
we can be protected on this ship.

35:16.480 --> 35:17.320
Do you understand?

35:24.400 --> 35:25.320
Shrimp,

35:28.840 --> 35:31.360
actually, with today's Treasure Hunt,

35:31.440 --> 35:32.440
I was gambling, too.

35:34.040 --> 35:35.400
I was betting that Master

35:36.520 --> 35:37.640
would come to save me.

35:40.320 --> 35:41.240
I didn't expect

35:42.880 --> 35:44.080
that I was right.

35:47.000 --> 35:48.280
So, at the very least,

35:49.160 --> 35:52.400
now, on this ship, we're safe.

35:52.480 --> 35:53.440
We're protected.

35:57.160 --> 35:58.800
Staying on this ship

35:59.480 --> 36:01.200
is not just about getting the pearl back.

36:01.840 --> 36:02.720
There's one more thing.

36:04.040 --> 36:07.040
I want to learn the trade

36:07.640 --> 36:09.760
and the ins and outs of this business.

36:10.280 --> 36:12.000
Do you remember

36:12.080 --> 36:16.080
I said I'd take you to be a peddler
or to open a shop?

36:16.160 --> 36:18.880
But we need
to understand the trade for that.

36:19.480 --> 36:22.000
So, staying here to learn isn't wrong.

36:22.080 --> 36:24.600
Sister, can we really open a shop?

36:25.920 --> 36:27.080
Why are you so excited?

36:27.160 --> 36:29.200
I want to open a shop with you!

36:29.840 --> 36:33.600
By then, our shop will be so big,

36:33.680 --> 36:36.680
much bigger than this lower deck!

36:36.760 --> 36:39.720
Every day, I'll polish the counter

36:39.800 --> 36:41.240
until it's spotless.

36:42.280 --> 36:46.040
And on opening day,
you'll have to wear bright red!

36:46.120 --> 36:48.040
And there'll be firecrackers at the door,

36:48.120 --> 36:50.080
so everyone in town comes to see.

36:50.160 --> 36:52.440
Why do I have to wear bright red?

36:53.160 --> 36:55.200
So your shop will flourish!

36:55.960 --> 36:57.520
Where'd you get that idea?

36:58.520 --> 37:00.920
Alright, we can do that.

37:01.000 --> 37:02.040
Then I'll…

37:02.800 --> 37:04.280
wear a bright red dress.

37:04.360 --> 37:06.080
What?

37:07.320 --> 37:08.560
It's a deal.

37:10.280 --> 37:11.520
Childish.

37:11.600 --> 37:13.560
Why bother with this?

37:14.160 --> 37:16.400
Alright, it's a deal.

37:16.480 --> 37:19.120
-I'll wear a bright red dress.
-It's a deal.

37:19.640 --> 37:21.120
And we'll set off firecrackers.
Don't forget it!

37:29.680 --> 37:32.080
Yan Zijing lost the Treasure Hunt.

37:32.160 --> 37:34.000
He won't let it go so easily.

37:34.840 --> 37:37.280
Send someone to get close
to his convoy members.

38:03.600 --> 38:05.920
Greetings to Steward Zhao, Accountant Wei.

38:17.480 --> 38:18.480
Greetings to Steward Zhao.

38:18.560 --> 38:19.840
Greetings to Accountant Wei.

38:19.920 --> 38:21.720
Greetings to Steward Zhao, Accountant Wei.

38:53.960 --> 38:54.800
Shrimp…

38:57.560 --> 39:00.520
I heard that Steward Zhao

39:00.600 --> 39:02.240
has a photographic memory.

39:03.160 --> 39:04.280
Did you know that?

39:05.600 --> 39:06.440
Yes!

39:06.520 --> 39:08.320
-I finally got to see it today.
-Yes.

39:08.400 --> 39:09.640
Truly an eye-opener.

39:11.400 --> 39:15.120
The Master has entrusted Steward Zhao
with managing all affairs on this ship.

39:15.200 --> 39:17.280
That shows how much he trusts him.

39:18.320 --> 39:20.800
We should learn from him.

39:21.760 --> 39:22.640
So young,

39:22.720 --> 39:24.880
and you've already moved up
from the lower deck to the convoy.

39:25.600 --> 39:28.240
You really do have some impressive skills.

39:28.320 --> 39:29.360
I'm flattered.

39:30.200 --> 39:34.080
I'll still need guidance from you
in the future.

39:34.800 --> 39:37.120
I heard you sold off scraps,

39:37.200 --> 39:40.000
recovered the money,
and made an extra 800 cash.

39:42.040 --> 39:44.520
-How did you do it?
-It had nothing to do with me.

39:46.120 --> 39:47.880
It was all thanks to Assistant Pang.

39:48.600 --> 39:49.560
And this time,

39:52.880 --> 39:54.920
-even more thanks to Accountant Wei.
-Yes, indeed.

39:55.000 --> 39:56.040
Thank you for the advice.

39:58.160 --> 39:59.600
I didn't advise you at all.

39:59.680 --> 40:01.840
It's your own skill.
It has nothing to do with me.

40:05.160 --> 40:07.520
I saw your transaction records
with Zhuobao House.

40:07.600 --> 40:09.280
The accounts are clear and organized,

40:09.360 --> 40:10.480
with accurate details and no errors.

40:13.040 --> 40:14.960
I've never heard Accountant Wei
praise anyone before.

40:18.360 --> 40:21.200
Reporting to Accountant Wei.
When I was at the pearl farm,

40:21.280 --> 40:22.680
I learned bookkeeping from the steward.

40:23.600 --> 40:25.160
But it's just basic knowledge,

40:25.240 --> 40:26.840
nowhere near your level.

40:29.720 --> 40:31.280
And you, Accountant Wei,

40:31.360 --> 40:33.680
have the books in hand
and numbers in mind.

40:34.440 --> 40:36.560
I could never reach that level
in my lifetime.

40:37.320 --> 40:38.520
Yes, indeed.

40:42.160 --> 40:43.240
It's all part of the job.

40:46.280 --> 40:47.120
Yes.

40:50.840 --> 40:52.280
Here's 1,000 cash.

40:52.360 --> 40:53.200
The Master instructed me
to give this to you.

40:53.280 --> 40:54.920
Use as you see fit.

40:56.400 --> 40:57.720
Sign the receipt.

41:08.520 --> 41:10.160
-Hu, Xiu,
-This…

41:10.240 --> 41:11.240
please take this.

41:11.320 --> 41:12.800
-What's this?
-Loud!

41:14.720 --> 41:16.400
So much money.

41:16.480 --> 41:19.840
You've been so kind to us. Thank you!

41:21.880 --> 41:24.440
Duanwu, you're lucky to have survived.

41:24.520 --> 41:27.320
I heard the Treasure Hunt was dangerous.

41:27.400 --> 41:28.720
But seeing you safe now,

41:30.080 --> 41:30.920
I must congratulate you.

41:31.680 --> 41:32.680
In all my time here,

41:32.760 --> 41:36.000
it's the first time I've seen
a servant make it to the upper deck.

41:37.400 --> 41:39.320
Yes. Congratulations, Duanwu.

41:39.960 --> 41:43.360
In the future, we'll rely on you.

41:44.200 --> 41:46.440
There's no need to be so formal.

41:47.760 --> 41:50.080
Once Shrimp and I are on the upper deck,

41:50.160 --> 41:52.560
if you ever need any help, just ask us.

41:54.760 --> 41:56.200
Alright, let's eat.

41:56.280 --> 41:59.360
My sister went all around Guangzhou
to find these treats.

41:59.440 --> 42:00.320
If you don't eat,

42:00.400 --> 42:01.680
-I'll starve just looking at them.
-Try some!

42:01.760 --> 42:02.600
Chicken legs!

42:02.680 --> 42:03.880
Sister, have this.

42:28.280 --> 42:29.360
Who sent this?
